<https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#scenario/low> a cleets:Scenario ;
    rdfs:label "low scenario"@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH0105>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH0142>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH1111>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH9901> ;
    rdfs:comment "2030 level cut to 50% (the lowest option of the 2026 mandate review). Each district follows the lower of its fitted diffusion curve and its turnover path. The Wales path is 75.32% of private cars at 2045 Q4, the predicted Wales share is 75.32% and Wales reaches 50% in 2040 Q1."@en ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#activity/diffusion-q2026rev> ;
    cleets:salesShareAt2030 0.5 ;
    cleets:scrappageRatesPeriod "2021 to 2025" ;
    cleets:terminalTargetShare 0.7532 .

<https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#scenario/central> a cleets:Scenario ;
    rdfs:label "central scenario"@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH0105>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH0142>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH1111>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH9901> ;
    rdfs:comment "Legislated sales rule, scrappage rates of 2021 to 2025. Each district follows the lower of its fitted diffusion curve and its turnover path. The Wales path is 81.14% of private cars at 2045 Q4, the predicted Wales share is 81.14% and Wales reaches 50% in 2038 Q2."@en ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#activity/diffusion-q2026rev> ;
    cleets:salesShareAt2030 0.8 ;
    cleets:scrappageRatesPeriod "2021 to 2025" ;
    cleets:terminalTargetShare 0.8114 .

<https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#scenario/high> a cleets:Scenario ;
    rdfs:label "high scenario"@en ;
    dcterms:source <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH0105>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH0142>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH1111>,
        <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#dataset/VEH9901> ;
    rdfs:comment "Scrappage rates of 2014 to 2019. Each district follows the lower of its fitted diffusion curve and its turnover path. The Wales path is 88.35% of private cars at 2045 Q4, the predicted Wales share is 88.35% and Wales reaches 50% in 2037 Q1."@en ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy <https://w3id.org/def/cleets/data#activity/diffusion-q2026rev> ;
    cleets:salesShareAt2030 0.8 ;
